  "answer": "This feature has been requested before. Awake has no start/end time window or weekday schedule today. The main tracking issue is PowerToys#24846 (Keep Awake on a Schedule). It is reopened, and a daily-window \"Scheduled\" mode has been proposed. The first version would cover one daily window and would not include weekday filters. Add a thumbs-up and your weekday requirement there. In the meantime, you can use Awake's CLI with Windows Task Scheduler. For example, run `PowerToys.Awake.exe --expire-at=18:00:00` at 09:00 on weekdays. A scheduled task that restarts Awake with an expiry time is the workaround described in PowerToys#27790."
